        "remove_vertical_spacing": false,
        "remove_horizontal_spacing": false,
        "liquid": "<div class=\"personality-eval-card\">\n  <h3>What to expect</h3>\n\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 0; padding: 0;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: start;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; background-color: #2B5275; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 10px; display: block;\"></span>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3D2D29;\">\n        A clinical interview to better understand current concerns, relevant history, and evaluation goals.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: start;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; background-color: #2B5275; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 10px; display: block;\"></span>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3D2D29;\">\n        Review of relevant background information, which may include prior treatment, records, or collateral information when appropriate.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: start;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; background-color: #2B5275; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 10px; display: block;\"></span>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3D2D29;\">\n        Standardized psychological measures selected based on the referral question and areas of concern.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 10px 1fr; gap: 12px; align-items: start;\">\n      <span style=\"width: 7px; height: 7px; background-color: #2B5275; border-radius: 50%; margin-top: 10px; display: block;\"></span>\n      <p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: Montserrat, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #3D2D29;\">\n        An integrated written report with diagnostic impressions, treatment considerations, and recommendations for next steps.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
